      "trackName": "Ski Dash for Watch Games",
      "description": "Experience an adrenaline-pumping skiing adventure right on your wrist. Navigate down treacherous snowy slopes, avoiding rocks and obstacles to stay ahead of the chasing danger. Use the digital crown to precisely adjust your ski board's angle for perfect landings and maneuvers.\nKey Features:\n\t•\tPrecise Control: Rotate the crown to tilt your board and maintain balance.\n\t•\tSpeed Boosts: Collect special power-ups for an instant burst of velocity.\n\t•\tFlight Mode: Grab flight items to soar through the air and bypass difficult terrain.\n\t•\tEndless Challenge: Test your reflexes in a fast-paced survival race.",
